1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
They came to watch a rehearsal.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,880
Then the rehearsal marked them back.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,800
A mouth becomes projection. A face becomes a surface.

4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:12,140
The audience sits inches away, pretending to be outside it.

5
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:15,880
But when the mark lands, who is watching whom?

